        "promptState": {
          "text": "How the reference pictures align with the target video — <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) aligns with the 4.00-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 3D CG animated character style, a full-body shot frames a white bunny warrior in a rugged stone training courtyard with a rough gray backdrop, dusty ground, and worn wooden posts, standing in a strong battle-ready pose with one foot planted forward and her arms lifted with controlled tension. She wears a rough light-brown leather warrior outfit with fitted straps, a short weathered skirt, and sturdy wrapped footwear, while her long ears stand alert and her expression stays focused. She shifts her weight onto one foot and begins a smooth pirouette as the camera arcs around her with small amplitude at slow speed; during the turn, the leather straps soften and refine, the rough skirt unfurls into layered pink ruffles, the fitted leather bodice reshapes into a delicate pink ballet bodice, and the wrapped footwear lengthens into pink pointe shoes with ribbon ties while the dusty courtyard and wooden posts fade into a clean soft gray studio backdrop with a pale pink floor. As the spin loses momentum, she rises fully onto pointe, opens both arms softly to the sides, and settles into the exact ballerina pose, costume, facial identity, white fur, violet eyes, long ears, lighting, viewpoint, and full-body composition established by Picture 1.\n\noverall_soundscape: Light open-air ambience with a faint breeze, distant soft wood creaks, gentle foot contact on the ground at the start, subtle fabric rustle during the turn, and a soft airy movement through her fur.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Soft solo violin and delicate harp begin with a restrained slow rhythm, joined by light strings as the pirouette develops. The music stays gentle and flowing, swells slightly during the transformation, and resolves into a quiet graceful finish at the end.",
